        "content": "## Feedback sentiment analysis\nA web form collects feedback. An LLM classifies it as Positive, Negative or Neutral and the matching alert is sent to Telegram.\n\n**Before running**\n- Replace `YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID` in the three notify nodes\n- Connect Telegram and OpenAI credentials (any OpenAI-compatible provider works)\n- If your provider only supports chat completions, keep **Use Responses API** switched off in the model node\n\nThe output schema forces the model to return exactly `Positive`, `Negative` or `Neutral`, so the Switch node always has a value to match.",
